          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God the [compassionate, the merciful.]</li>\n<li>Details of the purchases of my lord and mast [er &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>b. Ibr\u0101h\u012bm b. \u02bfAll\u0101n, may God perpetuate his glory.</li>\n<li>\u02bfAbdall\u0101h al-B\u016b\u1e63\u012br\u012b: 40 ra\u1e6dls, gross (wasa\u1e6d), price: 1 d\u012bn\u0101r less a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d.</li>\n<li>Sons of \u02bfAbd al-\u1e62amad: 38 ra\u1e6dl, fine (naq\u012b), price: 1 d\u012bn\u0101r&nbsp;less a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d; \u02bfAl\u012b:</li>\n<li>133 [ra\u1e6dls], fine; price: 3 [d\u012bn\u0101rs] and one-quarter. Weight of Na\u1e63r\u016bn:</li>\n<li>sent, minus 5 ra\u1e6dls; gross; price: 2 d\u012bn\u0101rs. Weight of</li>\n<li>the q\u0101\u1e0d\u012b: 134 [ra\u1e6dls], gross, remainder 25; price: 4 d\u0101niqs less one-sixth.</li>\n<li>The brokers (al-sam\u0101sira): 26 ra\u1e6dls, gross; price: 1 d\u012bn\u0101r, weighed.</li>\n<li>Idr\u012bs: 100 ra\u1e6dls, fine; price: 5 d\u0101niqs, weighed.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b: 100 ra\u1e6dls, fine; price: 2 d\u012bn\u0101rs and one-quarter, counted.</li>\n<li>Idr\u012bs: 125 [ra\u1e6dls], gross; price: 3 [d\u012bn\u0101rs] less 2 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds and one-half, weighed.</li>\n<li>Farh\u0101s: 86 [ra\u1e6dls], gross; price: 1 d\u012bn\u0101r&nbsp;and two-thirds, weighed.</li>\n<li>al-Kha\u1e6d\u012bb: 155 ra\u1e6dls, fine; price: 7 d\u0101niqs and one-third, weighed.</li>\n<li>Idr\u012bs: 144 [ra\u1e6dls], gross; price: 3 [d\u012bn\u0101rs] and one-third, weighed.</li>\n<li>The brokers &mdash; for madder plants: 146 [ra\u1e6dls]; price: 3 [d\u012bn\u0101rs] and one-half and an one-eighth, weighed.</li>\n<li>al-Idr\u012bj\u012b: 20 ra\u1e6dls; price: &frac12; dinar,</li>\n<li>&mdash; and returned to him: 1 d\u012bn\u0101r. Weighed: 1 d\u012bn\u0101r&nbsp;less a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d.</li>\n<li>Bahabsh\u012bm for 4 loads</li>\n<li>of the first 200, at a rate of 12 and one-half and one-quarter &mdash;</li>\n<li>what is added to our account: 53 d\u012bn\u0101rs and one-half.</li>\n<li>For 3 loads and one-half and 11 ra\u1e6dls</li>\n<li>fine, at a rate of 11 and one-half: 40 d\u012bn\u0101rs and one-half, weighed.</li>\n<li>And from Bahabsh\u012bm for gold (\u02bfayn = gold coin) received,</li>\n<li>320 ra\u1e6dl, gross; price: 8 d\u0101niqs, weighed.</li>\n<li>Idr\u012bja for 4 loads and one-half:</li>\n<li>expenses (m\u016bna): 10 d\u0101niqs per load: 45 dinars, weighed.</li>\n<li>From it, for 8 loads and one-half and 86</li>\n<li>ra\u1e6dls at a rate of 12 [q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds] per load; price: 104 d\u012bn\u0101rs, weighed.</li>\n<li>Half of what was held up in Idr\u012bja: 5 d\u0101niqs and a half and a quarter and 2 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds.</li></ol>\n",
