          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, left column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[&hellip; ra\u1e6dl and one quarter &hellip;]</li>\n<li>Total of all that: 338 d\u012bn\u0101rs&nbsp;and 2 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds.</li>\n<li>\u27e6Farh\u0101s: 107 ra\u1e6dl &mdash; 5 d\u0101niqs less a sixth\u27e7 Idr\u012bs: 2 d\u012bn\u0101rs.</li>\n<li>All [the goods] were baled into 34 bales, and owed for them:</li>\n<li>Carrying the flax via Bahabsh\u012bm and hiring beasts: 53 dirhams less one quarter.</li>\n<li>Hiring beasts to Dil\u0101\u1e63, and bringing in the flax</li>\n<li>via Bahabsh\u012bm, and a gratuity to the carters &mdash; his share: 22&frac12; dirhams.</li>\n<li>Carrying the flax from Idr\u012bja, bringing it in, and a gratuity</li>\n<li>to the carters: 30&frac12; dirhams.</li>\n<li>Expenses of the packers, storage fee (\u1e25iz\u0101mayn &rarr; kufra), market fee (s\u016bq), carrying,</li>\n<li>and bribe (bar\u1e6d\u012bl) for the first 12: 35 dirhams.</li>\n<li>Expenses of the packers, storage fee, market fee, carrying,</li>\n<li>and bribe for the other 17: 65 dirhams.</li>\n<li>Expenses of the packers, storage fee, market fee, carrying,</li>\n<li>and bribe for the 5 of the third portion: 16 dirhams.</li>\n<li>Bribe for the whole: two-thirds and a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d.</li>\n<li>Baling the 4 bales: 2 d\u012bn\u0101rs&nbsp;and one-half.</li>\n<li>Price of the inner packing cloth and dispatch documents for 34 [bales]: 5 d\u0101niqs less one-eighth.</li>\n<li>Outer packing cloth for 34 bales: 4 d\u0101niqs less one quarter.</li>\n<li>String (khay\u1e6d) for them: 34 dirhams.</li>\n<li>Rope (\u1e25abl) for them: &frac12; and &frac14; and \u215b d\u012bn\u0101r.</li>\n<li>Scribe (k\u0101tib): 17 dirhams.</li>\n<li>Brokerage (samsara): 6 d\u0101niqs and two-thirds.</li>\n<li>Boat hire (kir\u0101\u02be markab) for 29 [units]: 3 d\u0101niqs and 5 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds.</li>\n<li>Total gold (\u02bfayn): 22 d\u012bn\u0101rs&nbsp;and two-thirds and a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d,</li>\n<li>Silver (waraq): 373&frac14; [dirhams],</li>\n<li>at an exchange rate of 35: 8 d\u0101niqs and 2 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds.</li>\n<li>Total gold and silver: 30 d\u012bn\u0101rs, two-thirds, and one-eighth.</li>\n<li>Total amount for the 34 bales: 369 d\u012bn\u0101rs less one-eighth.</li></ol>\n",
